    "负数和零均合法；不能跳过元素，不能选择空段，返回和而非下标。"
  ],
  "constraints_html": "<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>",
  "source": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/2104ae8bdd661a1ebb6b5c703f050b8060b51e32/solution/0000-0099/0053.Maximum%20Subarray/README.md",
